Package: ros.form.references
Title: Shared Reference Data for Regional Observer Scheme Forms
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr")
Description: Provides the package foundation for shared reference data used by
    Regional Observer Scheme exporters and validators. Reference selection is
    based on versioned form models, with generic catalogue access supplied by
    form.references.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/ros.form.references/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/ros.form.references
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/ros.form.references/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ros.form.model (== 0.3.0), form.references (== 0.2.1)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, htmltools
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Remotes: ultreia-io/ros.form.model@v0.3.0,
    ultreia-io/form.references@v0.2.1
